flowchart TD
    Start([Task received]) --> Budget{Step or cost budget remaining?}
    Budget -->|No| Handoff[Stop: hand off to a human, task incomplete]
    Budget -->|Yes| Decide["Model decides: call a tool, ask a question, or finish"]
    Decide -->|Final answer| Done([Done])
    Decide -->|Tool call| Perm{Tool call passes permission and schema check?}
    Perm -->|No| Reject["Reject: error observation appended to context"]
    Perm -->|Yes| Exec["Execute tool (sandboxed, idempotency key attached)"]
    Exec --> Observe["Observation appended to context"]
    Reject --> Observe
    Observe --> Budget
